        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ludwig van Beethoven, Luigi Cherubini, Franz Schreker\n- Works: Médée, Irrelohe\n- Concepts: Beethoven’s opinions of contemporaries\n\nFacts:\n- Ludwig van Beethoven regarded Luigi Cherubini, the composer of the opéra-comique Médée, as the greatest of his contemporaries.\n- Ludwig van Beethoven did not regard Franz Schreker, the composer of Irrelohe, as highly as Luigi Cherubini.",
